Science Conference statement on Manifestations and Management of Chronic Insomnia in Adults, June 13-15, 2005</article-title><source>Sleep</source><year>2005</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>1049</fpage><lpage>57</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16268373</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><article-title>American Academy of Sleep Medicine. International classification of sleep disorders</article-title><source>Diagnostic and coding manual</source><year>2005</year><edition>2nd ed</edition><publisher-loc>Westchester (IL)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>American Academy of Sleep Medicine</publisher-name></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Edinger</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonnet</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Bootzin</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Doghramji</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Dorsey</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Espie</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>American Academy of Sleep Medicine Work Group.Derivation of research diagnostic criteria for insomnia: Report of an American Academy of Sleep Medicine Work Group</article-title><source>Sleep</source><year>2004</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>1567</fpage><lpage>96</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15683149</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Czeisler</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Winkelman</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Richardson</surname><given-names>GS</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Braun